{
  "tema": 5231,
  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-ir",
  "titulo": "Conjugate irregular verb ir in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "The stem is irregular, the endings aren't. And vamos is not the same as que vayamos.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Ir has the irregular stem vay- with regular endings: vaya, vayas, vaya, vayamos, vayan.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ir** is irregular in the present subjunctive because it has an **irregular stem: vay-**. The **yo** trick doesn't work here (**voy** gives you nothing). But the **endings are regular**: the same **-a, -as, -a, -amos, -an** as **-er** and **-ir** verbs."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**vay-**",
            "**-a, -as, -a, -amos, -an**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "ir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "vaya"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "vayas"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "vaya"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "vayamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "vayan"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **vaya** sounds like **valla**, the fence around the garden. To go anywhere in the subjunctive, first you jump the fence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "No creo que ==vaya== a la fiesta después.",
              "en": "I don't think I'll go to the party later."
            },
            {
              "es": "No quiero que ==vayas== sola a Rosarito.",
              "en": "I don't want you to go to Rosarito alone."
            },
            {
              "es": "No me impresiona que ==vaya== en un BMW.",
              "en": "It doesn't impress me that he goes around in a BMW."
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto sugiere que ==vayamos== en la mañana, cuando no hay viento.",
              "en": "Beto suggests we go in the morning, when there's no wind."
            },
            {
              "es": "Es buena idea que ==vayan== juntos.",
              "en": "It's a good idea for you to go together."
            },
            {
              "es": "Me encanta que ==vayan== de campamento.",
              "en": "I love that they're going camping."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "After a trigger, don't use the ordinary present (**voy, vas, vamos**), and don't build the stem from **ir**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "No quiero que vas sola."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "No quiero que vayas sola."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Sugiere que vamos en la mañana."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Sugiere que vayamos en la mañana."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "¡Vamos a la playa!"
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "¡No vayamos a la playa!"
                }
              ],
              "nota": "To say _let's go_, Mexican Spanish uses **vamos**. In the negative, the subjunctive is used: **no vayamos**. See [[6961|nosotros commands]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "usos",
      "titulo": "Vaya in other places",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "Quiero que vayas.",
              "texto": "After a trigger with **que**.",
              "aqui": true
            },
            {
              "forma": "No vayas.",
              "texto": "The negative **tú** command. See [[9255|negative commands]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "Vaya con cuidado.",
              "texto": "The **usted** command. **Váyase** if it's **irse**."
            },
            {
              "forma": "Que te vaya bien.",
              "texto": "The everyday goodbye: it's a wish, so it takes the subjunctive."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
